# ============================================================================
#  SIRAJ BUILDERS — LOCAL ENVIRONMENT
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Already filled in with the Supabase project you supplied, so `npm run dev`
#  works straight after `npm install`. Nothing to edit to get started.
#
#  This project is Create React App, so the build only injects variables
#  prefixed REACT_APP_. See scripts/env-bridge.js if you prefer VITE_ names.
